<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25973" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασύρ-ω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σέσυρκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					75
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σεσύρθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1433b6
				</span></i>
			:—<i>tear in pieces,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέα</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Hist.
				76
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>pull to pieces,</i> i.e. <i>to disparage,
				ridicule,</i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				141.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				237
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεσύρε τὰ παρόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					13.12
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιδορούμενος καὶ διασύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					18.180
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.3.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.59
			</span></i> W., etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>break up, disperse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.42.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>draw through,</i> Paul. Aeg.<i><span class="en">
				6.25
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be drawn to one side,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hippiatr.
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
